<title>USA: Transmation to post gain from land sale.</title>
<headline>Transmation to post gain from land sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROCHESTER, N.Y. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transmation Inc said on Monday it will report a pretax gain of nearly $525,000 from the sale of 26 acres of land in Henrietta, N.Y.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale, with a total price of approximately $750,000, will be used to reduce debt, Transmation said.</p>
</text>
